OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral assault dad arrested after
OL,4,Acourt no-show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of one of the victims of a
OL,7,Ffatal head-on crash, which also killed
OL,8,Ftwo police officers, has been arrested
OL,9,Fagain after failing to turn up at court
OL,10,Fover an assault at his own son's
OL,11,Ffuneral.
OL,13,FGye Worthy, 40, was due to be sentenced
OL,14,Ffor common assault against a celebrant
OL,15,Fat Teesside Crematorium in
OL,16,FMiddlesbrough on 9 September.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
