OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral assault dad arrested after
OL,4,Acourt no-show
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the time he was attending the
OL,7,Ffuneral of his son Cole, 17, one of
OL,8,Fseven who died when the Volkswagen
OL,9,FPassat he was in hit a marked police
OL,10,Fcar on the A66 in South Bank on 22
OL,11,FAugust.
OL,13,FAn arrest warrant was issued when
OL,14,FWorthy failed to turn up at Teesside
OL,15,FCrown Court on Tuesday where he was due
OL,16,Fto be sentenced for the assault and
OL,17,Fresisting arrest.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
